sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant R as AccountController
    participant U as CreateAccountUseCaseImpl
    participant CP as CustomerClientPort
    participant W as CustomerWebClientAdapter
    participant CS as customer-service
    participant P as AccountPersistencePort
    participant M as MongoDB

    C->>R: POST /api/v1/accounts
    R->>U: execute(account)
    U->>CP: getById(customerId)
    CP->>W: GET http://customer-service/api/v1/customers/{id}
    W->>CS: (vía Eureka, circuit breaker, timeout 2s)
    CS-->>W: CustomerInfo(type, profile, hasOverdueDebit)
    W-->>CP: CustomerInfo
    CP-->>U: CustomerInfo
    alt cliente con deuda (hasOverdueDebit=true)
        U-->>R: rechazo
        R-->>C: 409 (cliente bloqueado)
    else reglas de tenencia violadas
        U-->>R: rechazo
        R-->>C: 409 (límite: 1 SAVINGS / 1 CURRENT)
    else ok
        U->>P: save(account)
        P->>M: save
        M-->>P: document
        P-->>U: Account
        U-->>R: Account
        R-->>C: 201 Created
    end
